    "en": {
      "trackName": "TowerStacker Arcade",
      "description": "TowerStacker Arcade is a fast-paced, skill-based stacking game built for quick sessions and high-score runs across iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, Mac, and Apple TV.\n\nTime each drop perfectly to build the tallest, cleanest tower you can. Keep your rhythm, chain precision landings, and chase higher combos as the speed ramps up.\n\nEarn coins, unlock themes and skins, and personalize every run while climbing the leaderboards.\n\nFeatures:\n• Easy to learn, hard to master one-tap gameplay\n• Precision scoring, streaks, and combo-driven runs\n• Unlockable themes and skins\n• Daily challenges and long-term progression\n• Game Center leaderboards\n• Native controls across every device:\n  – Touch on iPhone and iPad\n  – Crown/tap play on Apple Watch\n  – Mouse + keyboard on Mac\n  – Siri Remote support on Apple TV\n\nCan you master the perfect stack?",
