      "releaseNotes": "What's new in TowerStacker Arcade 1.2:\n\n• Improved block skins and backgrounds — unlock and customize your tower with unique themes\n• Improved progression system — earn coins, complete challenges, and track your stats\n• Improved store — browse and unlock new skins and backgrounds\n• Improved trophy case and standings — see how you rank and show off your achievements\n• Improved gameplay tuning and performance\n• Bug fixes and stability improvements",
