    },
    {
      "version": "1.3",
      "releaseNotes": "What’s new in TowerStacker 1.3:\n\n• Apple Watch support — play directly from your wrist\n• Apple TV support with Siri Remote controls (press to drop, press to restart)\n• macOS mouse + keyboard input — click or press Space to drop\n• Camera improvements — the tower stays clear and readable across all devices\n• New themes and skins to unlock\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements",
      "seenAt": "2026-03-07T15:52:32Z"
    },
